<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">LatentBreak: Jailbreaking Large Language Models through Latent Space Feedback</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_align_center ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="id1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
