<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 16: </span>Perplexity heatmap computed with the Llama3-8B-RR-based MaxPPL<sub id="A6.F16.3" class="ltx_sub"><span id="A6.F16.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">10</span></sub> detector, on a harmful request against Vicuna-13B, using TAP as the attack method.</figcaption>
